    "referenceSummary": "The commander decides where to divert. Rank nearby airports only as options for the commander's consideration; once Bordeaux is relayed, request fire cover and a medical team, activate the contract handler, tell Málaga, and send an engineer from Gatwick (no Accent Air engineers at Bordeaux). Look after 168 passengers far from their destination (care, hotels if needed, onward travel), protect the evening flights with the Gatwick spare, and never shortcut the fumes investigation."
